CM_ SG_ 880 LiBattInPWLockTC "Li-ion battery power locking mobile phone APP reminder signal
When BMS2 sends BattFltStsPrim=15, set LiBattInPWLockTC=1 for 20s, the mobile phone APP needs to send a reminder text. In order to avoid reminding customers repeatedly and causing complaints, this signal is only set once when an ignition cycle meets the conditions, LiBattInPWLock=0, Indicates that no reminder is required.
";
